==English==

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|phrasal verb|head=to [[ask]] for}}

# to [[request]]
#: ''I '''asked for''' a glass of water.
# {{context|idiomatic|lang=en}} To [[increase]] the [[likelihood]] of something by [[persisting]] in some [[action]]; to [[invite]].
#: ''If you keep on speeding, you are '''asking for''' trouble.''

